DESCRIPTION:Community tribute hosted by Merced Sunrise Rotary Club remember
 ing local fallen service members. Kids’ 400m starts at 8:20 a.m.\; 5K ru
 n/walk and 10K start at 9 a.m. Online registration closes November 5 at 6 
 p.m. Race-day registration and bib pickup run 7–8:30 a.m. Confirm ceremo
 ny timing with the organizer.\n\nCost: 5K/10K registration free without a 
 shirt\; optional shirts $25 while supplies last\n\nListed start is the kid
 s’ race. Published 5K/10K time block is 9–11 a.m.\n\nSource: Merced Su
 nrise Rotary Club / RunSignup\nhttps://runsignup.com/Race/CA/Merced/Runfor
 theFallen5K10kMerced
LOCATION:Merced College\, 3600 M Street\, Merced\, CA 95348
CATEGORIES:Sports
