 asino. The public flyer advertises a $40 ticket with $10 gaming credit\, $
 5 food credit and a 25% gift-shop discount. Tickets are available at CVO o
 r Granny’s Pantry\; confirm availability and trip eligibility with the o
 rganizer. Casino gambling is restricted to ages 21 and older.\n\nCost: $40
  ticket\; advertised credits and discount subject to organizer/venue condi
 tions\n\nBus departs Atwater at 9 a.m.\; return is approximately 5 p.m. Th
 e listed end is the approximate return time. Confirm trip eligibility and 
 casino ID requirements with the organizer.\n\nSource: Castle Veterans Orga
 nization public organizer announcement\nhttps://www.facebook.com/photo/?fb
 id=1090005720695630&set=gm.1476805080973232&idorvanity=275560484431037
